<DTA TYPE="STRING">ASTM D3787 except polished steel ball replaced with a<MET> 8 mm</MET><ENG> 5/16 inch</ENG> diameter solid steel cylinder with a hemispherical tip centered within the ring clamp.</DTA>
         </CEL>
